  triage:notes "AckOutcome struct is nested (reply_disposition: AckReplyDisposition), same as pAG-s18 — current tip has not yet merge-forwarded AG.19's flattening fix. Doc mismatch is open here regardless: nested-doc vs nested-code disagree on the suppressed_self_ack path (no longer reachable per AG.19's deletion of the remote-ack path), and once AG.19 merges forward this branch will also need the flat-shape doc update." .
